> I have a multi-level example where I expect the relationship between two individual-level variables to be moderated by a group-level variable (one that varies only between-groups). Can I test this hypothesis using lavaan?

No, lavaan does not yet allow level-1 slopes/correlations to be random across level-2 units.  Only intercepts are random.

